      "url": "https://x.com/HardeepSPuri/status/2122386789407363518",
      "title_en": "India’s skies are turning greener, and a new chapter in our nation’s clean energy journey is taking flight! Under the dynamic leadership of PM Sh @narendramodi Ji, our transition towards greener energy witnesses a landmark stride in sustainable aviation. India has produced its first batch of Sustain",
      "title_zh": "石油部长：印度首批可持续航空燃料已在帕尼帕特炼厂产出并获准商用",
      "summary_en": "India’s skies are turning greener, and a new chapter in our nation’s clean energy journey is taking flight! \n\nUnder the dynamic leadership of PM Sh @narendramodi Ji, our transition towards greener energy witnesses a landmark stride in sustainable aviation. India has produced its first batch of Sustainable Aviation Fuel (SAF) through co-processing at @IndianOilcl’s Panipat Refinery, now cleared for commercial supply.\n\nFrom transforming used cooking oil into aviation fuel to securing India’s first ISCC CORSIA certification for SAF production, IndianOil’s pioneering journey reflects the spirit of innovation, self-reliance and environmental stewardship that defines a rising India.\n\nThis milestone brings us closer to our vision of cleaner skies, strengthens our indigenous green fuel capabilities and lends fresh momentum to India's energy transition and Net Zero 2070 aspirations.\n\nFor a nation whose ambitions know no bounds, even the sky is not the limit. And now, every takeoff can carry the promise of a greener tomorrow!\n\n#SustainableAviationFuel #GreenSkies #IndianOil #AtmanirbharBharat #EnergyTransition\n\n@PetroleumMin @PIB_India @MoCA_GoI @AAI_Official @ChairmanIOCL",
      "summary_zh": "石油部长哈迪普·辛格·普里称，印度石油公司帕尼帕特炼厂通过共处理产出首批可持续航空燃料（SAF），已获准商业供应，并取得印度首个ISCC CORSIA认证，以推进净零2070目标。",
